  (text "~CE: R4 към 3V3M = без заряд, докато MSPM0 не го свали (PA17). BQ25798 е на собствена I2C шина (SCL_I/SDA_I) към MSPM0. TP2 (QON) към GND = wake." (at 20 177.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 24de225e-0f4d-4c9b-a4b2-c118a449ac0d))
  (text "2. СИСТЕМНО ЗАХРАНВАНЕ (SYS -> идеален диод Q5 AO3401A + Q6/Q7 -> XIAO 5V) + XIAO nRF52840 & Wio-SX1262 + I2C" (at 225 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2a9f46f1-f212-4e56-a7ef-df4e30bacfca))
  (text "3. БАТЕРИЯ 1S (Li-ion / LiFePO4): Ship FET (Q2 + JP3) -> J4 -> BMS (DW01A + HJ8205) -> шунт RS1 20 mOhm -> GND" (at 20 188 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3e78f2d5-2363-4c14-ac0a-2a500613896b))
  (text "Q2 (AO3400A): S към BAT, D към батерията; в shutdown спира разреждането. За LiFePO4: затвори JP3 (без Q2)." (at 20 252 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f109a2b1-e9de-4de8-a798-299492809869))
  (text "BMS (DW01A + HJ8205) в минуса на батерията (BATT- -> BATT_S -> RS1 -> GND): защита от презареждане (4.3V), преразреждане (2.4V) и късо." (at 20 255.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 17da88fb-0de4-4ef4-bc04-cbd6d12e68cf))
  (text "LiFePO4: прагът 4.3V на DW01A е над 3.65V, т.е. от презареждане пази само VREG=3.6V на BQ25798; DW01A остава за 2.4V и късо/свръхток (~3A)." (at 20 259 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 27d31461-d1c6-4b14-9855-2ea1f2337044))
  (text "4. MSPM0L1306: BQ25798 (I2C1), INA260 0x41 + 0x42 (I2C0)" (at 430 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f38053ef-0a8d-4aff-92c3-30e674d2db98))
  (text "SWD отдолу, колона 2.54 (отгоре надолу): TP12 3V3M, TP15 NRST, TP11 SWDIO, TP14 SWCLK, TP13 GND." (at 430 170 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2d59eb81-0cee-4638-a9bb-6dbb0a4905cd))
  (text "I2C0 (PA10/PA11) = шината на Xiao: INA260 0x41 + 0x42. I2C1 (PA16/PA15) -> BQ25798." (at 430 173.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 47a7db48-17a6-4daf-9d8b-63378cca5a09))
  (text "~CE PA17, нагревател PA26, CHEM PA23, VBAT PA24/A3, шунт PA25/PA18 (OPA0/OPA1)." (at 430 177 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9446c74e-d956-4800-8884-51dc91af785c))
  (text "5. НАГРЕВАТЕЛ J6: SYS -> Q4 AO3400A, PWM от MSPM0 (PA26)" (at 430 260 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 26da1eca-25b5-49bb-9f1f-b1a242d0d110))
  (text "Студена батерия: MSPM0 спира заряда, BQ25798 продължава MPPT към SYS," (at 430 312 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 124edf71-4f3d-405a-bac5-140b37b3572d))
  (text "нагревателят взима излишъка от панела. MSPM0 намалява PWM, щом през" (at 430 315.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid efc2e865-3ea8-42bb-9194-3ed95ed8daf9))
  (text "шунта RS1 потече разряд. Рестарт / без MSPM0: R28 държи Q4 изключен." (at 430 319 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 56f09c00-789e-4209-b9ae-da480bb40824))
